      {
        "label": "AI",
        "text": "Rejected preemptive AI regulation and proposed a competitive investment framework, including limited liability for firms using AI agents and tax incentives. Advocated Western leadership in AI development.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S113",
            "quote": "That is why, when we hear that the state should control artificial intelligence, we should remember something basic."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S114",
            "quote": "The state is not an abstract creature."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S115",
            "quote": "It is made up of people, officials, and bureaucrats."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S116",
            "quote": "Granting it control over innovation means granting some people, in the best and most naive of cases, the power to limit what everyone else can create."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S117",
            "quote": "History gives us reason to scrutinize such power carefully."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S118",
            "quote": "For centuries, fear over tomorrow has been used as an argument for restricting freedoms today, always with the same promise: give us a part of your freedom and we will protect you from this new threat."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S119",
            "quote": "We will apply a different principle."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S120",
            "quote": "In the face of uncertainty, we propose determination."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S121",
            "quote": "In the face of fear, courage."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S122",
            "quote": "In the face of decline, ambition."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S123",
            "quote": "And in the face of resignation, we propose optimism."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S124",
            "quote": "That is why I tell you that, when it comes to artificial intelligence, Argentina will stand at the forefront of freedom."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S125",
            "quote": "We have the critical minerals, the energy, the talent, and the capacity to compete at every link in that value chain."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S126",
            "quote": "And we want to become the most competitive place in the world in which to develop it, with a cutting-edge legal framework, a commitment not to regulate preemptively, limited liability for companies operating with AI agents, and tax incentives."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S127",
            "quote": "And we want to become the most competitive place in the world in which to develop it, with a cutting-edge legal framework, a commitment not to regulate preemptively, limited liability for companies operating with AI agents, and tax incentives."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S128",
            "quote": "Because artificial intelligence is not geopolitically neutral, the West must lead the development of this technology to ensure that it is consistent with our fundamental libertarian values, namely respect for life, liberty, private property, and the notion of human dignity."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S129",
            "quote": "In that regard, we fully share President Trump's vision."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
