  "CYP": {
    "bullets": [
      {
        "label": "Cyprus settlement",
        "text": "Called for resumed negotiations on a bi-zonal, bi-communal federation with political equality under the UN framework. Criticized Türkiye’s actions in Cyprus and urged President Erdoğan to support substantive talks.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S070",
            "quote": "Fifty-two years have passed since the illegal Turkish invasion of Cyprus, an act of aggression violating the core principles of the UN Charter, an ongoing flagrant violation of international law, with more than a third of the territory of Cyprus remaining under Turkish occupation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S071",
            "quote": "For 52 years, tens of thousands of displaced persons and their descendants have been prevented from returning to their homes."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S072",
            "quote": "For 52 years, Varosha has remained sealed off, with Turkey still in defiance of its clear and very specific obligations set out in the relevant UN resolutions."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S073",
            "quote": "For 52 years, we have experienced violations of fundamental human rights, the destruction of religious and cultural heritage, and the organized transfer of settlers amounting to demographic change."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S074",
            "quote": "Pain and immense suffering are the daily reality for the relatives of the missing persons, who to this day are demanding answers as to the fate of their loved ones."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S075",
            "quote": "And for 52 years, the principles at stake have remained the same: respect for sovereignty and territorial integrity."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S076",
            "quote": "They are not rhetorical vehicles, nor are they to be applied selectively, depending on who the perpetrator is."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S077",
            "quote": "These principles do not become less important with the passage of time, nor do the resolutions of this organization."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S078",
            "quote": "UN resolutions cannot be upheld in one case and fully disregarded in another, and the sovereignty and territorial integrity of a state cannot depend on its size, its power, or the passage of time."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S079",
            "quote": "And this is not only a question for Cyprus."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S080",
            "quote": "It goes to the credibility of the international system itself."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S081",
            "quote": "If we ask states to believe in multilateralism, if we expect them to be active contributors, then they must be able to trust that the principles and decisions of our institutions will be upheld without exception."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S082",
            "quote": "Ladies and gentlemen, I listened very carefully to the speech of President Erdoğan yesterday."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S083",
            "quote": "References to international law, to respect for the sovereignty and territorial integrity of all states, to illegal occupation, to the drama of refugees."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S084",
            "quote": "Yet, in relation to my country, in relation to Cyprus, Turkey is doing exactly the opposite."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S085",
            "quote": "Hypocrisy of the highest form."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S086",
            "quote": "President Erdoğan yesterday also quoted extensively from the UN Charter."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S087",
            "quote": "But politicians are judged not by their words, but by their deeds."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S088",
            "quote": "And if Mr."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S089",
            "quote": "Erdoğan wants to quote from the Charter, he must first apply the Charter."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S090",
            "quote": "The UN Security Council has established the framework for the solution of the Cyprus problem."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S091",
            "quote": "That framework of a bi-zonal, bi-communal federation with political equality remains the only basis on which a comprehensive settlement must be reached."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S092",
            "quote": "And I remain fully committed to achieving a functional and viable solution."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S093",
            "quote": "I am ready to resume negotiations from where they left off, building on the substantial work already achieved."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S094",
            "quote": "The common ground is there: the relevant UN Security Council resolutions, international law, and the values and principles of the European Union."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S095",
            "quote": "What is now required is political will by all parties and a genuine willingness to return to meaningful negotiations, to engage seriously, to build on the body of work already achieved, and to reach a settlement that reunifies our country and our people, a settlement that allows Greek and Turkish Cypriots, Maronites, Armenians, and Latins to live together in peace, security, and prosperity."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S096",
            "quote": "On my side, let me repeat it: I am fully committed."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S097",
            "quote": "Because, ladies and gentlemen, division will not be accepted."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S098",
            "quote": "This cannot and will not be the future for my country and my people, ever."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S099",
            "quote": "Our determination to reunify our island is firm."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S100",
            "quote": "I therefore call on my Turkish Cypriot compatriots to perceive our future together as an opportunity for prosperity."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S101",
            "quote": "And, of course, I call on President Erdoğan to give the green light for substantive negotiations within the UN-agreed framework."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Humanitarian role",
        "text": "Highlighted the Amalthea maritime corridor for Gaza, cooperation with the UN 2720 mechanism, evacuation assistance, and aid to disaster- and conflict-affected countries, including Sudan and the Sahel.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S040",
            "quote": "Following the Hamas terrorist attack of 2023 and the devastating humanitarian situation in Gaza, Cyprus put forward the Amalthea Maritime Humanitarian Corridor."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S041",
            "quote": "Cyprus could offer something specific: its geographical position, its infrastructure, its excellent relationships with all countries in the region, and the will to engage with international partners."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S042",
            "quote": "Through cooperation, including with the UN 2720 mechanism, that idea became a proposal and evolved into a functioning humanitarian route, one that keeps delivering as we speak."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S043",
            "quote": "Cyprus has also played a constructive role in times of emergency."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S044",
            "quote": "When third-country nationals needed to be evacuated from our neighbourhood, my country has served time and time again as a safe harbour."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S045",
            "quote": "Our infrastructure and our resources have been made available in order to facilitate safe passage for people in danger."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S046",
            "quote": "In the last three years alone, we helped evacuate thousands of citizens from 70 different countries."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S047",
            "quote": "Through Cyprus Aid, we have provided humanitarian assistance to countries facing natural disasters."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S048",
            "quote": "Cyprus was among the first responders following the catastrophic earthquake in Türkiye and the flash floods in Libya."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S049",
            "quote": "The devastating humanitarian situation in Sudan and the wider Sahel region have also been a priority for my country, with a large percentage of our resources directed to the region."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Regional partnerships",
        "text": "Cited regional climate cooperation, the EU-supported aerial firefighting station at Paphos, and the land, maritime, and port-security center jointly created with the United States as examples of practical cooperation.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S050",
            "quote": "Ladies and gentlemen, rising temperatures, water scarcity, and extreme weather affect us all, transcending borders and politics."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S051",
            "quote": "In the Eastern Mediterranean and the Middle East, the interweaving political realities that we are facing are further amplified by the climate crisis."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S052",
            "quote": "Cooperation is therefore the only answer."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S053",
            "quote": "This is the purpose of Cyprus's regional initiative on climate change: to bring together countries of the region, thus strengthening our collective capacity for adaptation, mitigation, and resilience."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S054",
            "quote": "Another manifestation of this is the Cyprus Regional Aerial Firefighting Station, hosted at Paphos Air Base and supported by the European Union."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S055",
            "quote": "It offers an operational hub for aerial firefighting and rapid response, and a centre of excellence for training, interoperability, and capacity building."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S056",
            "quote": "Reflecting its emphasis on regional ownership, it brings together partners from the Middle East, North Africa, and the Gulf."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S057",
            "quote": "This commitment to regional cooperation and regional engagement is also demonstrated through the Cyprus Center for Land, Open Seas, and Port Security, jointly created with the United States."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S058",
            "quote": "In its four years of operation, it has provided specialized training to thousands of government officials from more than 50 countries in the Middle East, Africa, and Europe."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Multilateral reform",
        "text": "Supported UN80, the Pact for the Future, and the 2030 Agenda, arguing that reform must preserve consistent application of international law and equal rights for small states.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S009",
            "quote": "International law, the UN Charter, respect for sovereignty and territorial integrity, the peaceful settlement of disputes, respect for human rights, the equality of states: all these are not principles of the past."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S010",
            "quote": "They are principles that transcend time, the essential ingredients for the present and for the future."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S011",
            "quote": "The challenge before us is therefore clear."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S012",
            "quote": "As the world changes, our institutions must be able to respond to new realities and threats while guided by the painful lessons of history and the vision of the founding fathers of this organization."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S013",
            "quote": "And this is the essence of the theme of the 81st General Assembly: restoring trust, managing transformation, a United Nations that delivers for all."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S014",
            "quote": "Ladies and gentlemen, transformation is inevitable."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S015",
            "quote": "What must remain constant is the UN Charter as our compass."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S016",
            "quote": "It directs all of us, irrespective of power, size, and leverage."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S017",
            "quote": "For small states, the principle of equality of states is fundamental, and it has formed the binding trust between us."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S018",
            "quote": "We rely on an international system in which sovereignty and territorial integrity are respected."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S019",
            "quote": "We expect international law, including the UN Convention on the Law of the Sea, to be applied consistently."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S020",
            "quote": "We believe in the peaceful resolution of disputes, and we demand that the rights of every state be protected."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S021",
            "quote": "These are the integral elements of our collective trust, and this is the code of conduct of Cyprus's diplomatic engagement."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S022",
            "quote": "In a rapidly changing world, small states must seek synergies while continuing to pursue strategic autonomy."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S023",
            "quote": "Preserving trust also requires institutions capable of responding to the world as it is today."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S024",
            "quote": "The United Nations must therefore continue to evolve."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S025",
            "quote": "The UN80 Initiative is an important part of this effort."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S026",
            "quote": "The Pact for the Future and the 2030 Agenda and its Sustainable Development Goals are also part of the effort to ensure that multilateral cooperation can respond to the needs of our time."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S027",
            "quote": "This moment of reform also comes as the UN Secretary-General approaches the completion of a decade leading this organization."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S028",
            "quote": "Cyprus wishes to acknowledge his leadership during a period of extraordinary global developments, his steadfast commitment to multilateralism, and his efforts to strengthen and reform the UN."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S029",
            "quote": "But reforming our structural setup is only part of the answer."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S030",
            "quote": "What is also needed is a genuine willingness of member states to contribute to and protect the multilateral system."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S031",
            "quote": "After all, states bring different capabilities, experiences, and perspectives."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S032",
            "quote": "Great powers have scale; smaller states must have persuasion."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S033",
            "quote": "We cannot compel, but we can coalesce."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S034",
            "quote": "We cannot dictate outcomes, but together we can help shape them."
          }
        ]
      }
