  "SWZ": {
    "bullets": [
      {
        "label": "UN representation and peace",
        "text": "Called for permanent African representation on the Security Council, stronger African-led mediation, and UN monitoring of compliance with peace agreements. Urged support for regional responses to unconstitutional changes of government.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S019",
            "quote": "Since the Ezulwini Consensus was adopted in 2005, sadly, Africa still has no permanent seat on the UN Security Council."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S020",
            "quote": "And yet, the continent remains a global strategic partner on the world stage."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S021",
            "quote": "The question is: how many more years should African leaders travel to New York and stand before this Assembly to call for fair representation in the UN Security Council?"
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S023",
            "quote": "President, we are being deprived of the opportunity to contribute to global security issues."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S024",
            "quote": "We meet at a time when multiple wars and armed conflicts continue to claim lives, destroy infrastructure, and displace communities across various regions of the world."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S025",
            "quote": "Beyond the immediate human tragedy, these conflicts exert a heavy economic toll."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S026",
            "quote": "They divert resources that are urgently needed for development into military expenditure."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S027",
            "quote": "They also drive up energy and transportation costs, disrupt global supply chains, and exacerbate the rising cost of living felt by people everywhere."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S028",
            "quote": "Peace remains the indispensable foundation upon which all development is built."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S029",
            "quote": "Where there is war, development is reversed."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S030",
            "quote": "Where there is instability, investment withdraws."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S031",
            "quote": "Where there is fear, human potential is lost."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S032",
            "quote": "The Kingdom of Eswatini remains deeply concerned by the continued conflicts and humanitarian crises affecting various parts of our world."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S033",
            "quote": "We call for the continued pursuit of diplomatic and political solutions to these conflicts."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S034",
            "quote": "While war may create temporary victors on the battlefield, only through dialogue can sustainable peace be established."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S035",
            "quote": "The United Nations must remain the place where the door to dialogue never closes."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S036",
            "quote": "On the African continent, continued instability validates the urgent need to strengthen African-led peace processes."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S037",
            "quote": "There is also a need to support the capacity of African regional organizations to prevent conflict, mediate disputes, and build sustainable peace."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S038",
            "quote": "The Kingdom of Eswatini believes firmly that peace in Europe, the Middle East, and Africa must be anchored in preventive diplomacy, fully supported by the United Nations."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S039",
            "quote": "We call upon the UN to ensure that countries respect peace agreements that have been signed, to avoid drawing back on the gains already made, thus causing more destruction to infrastructure and innocent lives."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S040",
            "quote": "The UN should provide oversight to ensure follow-up and monitor compliance with these agreements so that they last forever."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S041",
            "quote": "During the 46th SADC Summit, Eswatini assumed the chairmanship of the SADC Organ on Politics, Defence and Security Cooperation Troika, whose mandate is to promote peace and stability in the Southern African region."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S042",
            "quote": "Through this responsibility, we will work closely with all member states to strengthen preventive diplomacy, enhance dialogue, and mediation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S043",
            "quote": "We believe that for SADC to attain its Vision 2050, we have to create a peaceful, competitive, and industrialized region that guarantees sustainable well-being and freedom for all our citizens."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S044",
            "quote": "The African Union's Agenda 2063 and its aspiration to silence the guns reflect our continent's resolve to end conflict and to create the stable conditions required for sustainable growth."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S045",
            "quote": "However, we are concerned by the continued incidence of unconstitutional changes of government, which run counter to the values and principles enshrined in the charters of the United Nations, the African Union, and the regional economic blocs."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S046",
            "quote": "Respect for constitutional order and the rule of law is fundamental to stability."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S047",
            "quote": "We urge the international community to speak with one voice against its erosion."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S048",
            "quote": "The United Nations should fully support decisions taken by regional bodies to condemn such acts, which cause immense suffering and uncertainty for millions of people."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Economic and digital capacity",
        "text": "Sought UN assistance for local mineral processing and an African commodities trading hub, supported AfCFTA, and called for responsible AI governance addressing safety, accountability, environmental effects, and human control.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S049",
            "quote": "Sustainable development must remain at the center of our collective endeavor."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S050",
            "quote": "The promise of the Sustainable Development Goals, SDGs, is a pledge that no person and no country should be left behind."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S051",
            "quote": "Yet, developing countries continue to face significant challenges, including limited access to finance, technology, infrastructure, healthcare, education, and productive investment."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S052",
            "quote": "Economic development must increasingly mean the structural transformation of our economies."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S053",
            "quote": "We need to shift from the exportation of unprocessed raw materials to value addition, local industrialization, and the creation of decent jobs within our own borders."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S054",
            "quote": "This economic growth objective is now inseparable from emerging technologies."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S055",
            "quote": "The transformation brought about by digitalization and artificial intelligence presents enormous opportunities for humanity."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S056",
            "quote": "It has the power to expand access to education, healthcare, financial services, and economic opportunities."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S057",
            "quote": "However, innovation must be governed by responsibility and accountability."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S058",
            "quote": "Emerging technologies, particularly artificial intelligence, are advancing faster than our current capacity to govern them while retaining human agency and control."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S059",
            "quote": "This raises critical questions regarding accountability, safety, environmental impact, and the risk of a widening digital divide between those who can shape these technologies and those who are excluded from their benefits in total."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S060",
            "quote": "The Kingdom of Eswatini remains committed to building a more resilient, diversified, and inclusive economy."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S061",
            "quote": "Our vision is to create an economy that generates decent employment, attracts sustained investment, and expands opportunities for our youth, women, and marginalized groups, amongst others, to strengthen their livelihoods."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S062",
            "quote": "To this end, we continue to invest strategically in human capital, infrastructure, healthcare, education, agriculture, tourism, industrialization, digital development, and mining, while positioning Eswatini effectively within regional and global value chains."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S063",
            "quote": "We appeal to the UN for support towards enhancing the capacity of African countries in developing value addition on their natural resources, as well as creating a trading hub for precious and earth minerals and other commodities for the continent."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S064",
            "quote": "In this regard, the African Continental Free Trade Area, AfCFTA, provides a vital platform for African nations to move beyond raw material exports towards greater value addition, industrial processing, and intra-African trade so as to fulfill our vision."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Health and climate",
        "text": "Requested WHO support for joint procurement of essential medicines by East, Central, and Southern African countries and stronger regional pharmaceutical manufacturing. Sought predictable, affordable climate finance and support for adaptation, food security, and irrigation.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S069",
            "quote": "Economic and social progress, however, remain vulnerable to global health crises."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S070",
            "quote": "The COVID-19 pandemic taught humanity a vital lesson."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S071",
            "quote": "No country can protect itself from a global health emergency alone."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S072",
            "quote": "Yet, even as we recover from that crisis, recent resurgences of mpox, recurring Ebola outbreaks, and other emerging infectious diseases remind us that our health systems must remain vigilant and resilient."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S073",
            "quote": "We must decisively address persistent inequalities in access to vaccines, medicines, and medical technologies."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S074",
            "quote": "Critically, the international community must support African countries in developing robust local and regional capacities to manufacture essential pharmaceuticals and health products."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S075",
            "quote": "In a recent meeting of the East, Central and Southern African Health Community Conference held in Eswatini, the countries resolved to act as a singular bloc when purchasing essential drugs and medical supplies."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S076",
            "quote": "This will help reduce costs and ensure supply chain stability."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S077",
            "quote": "We appeal to the UN, through the World Health Organization, to support this endeavor."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S078",
            "quote": "Parallel to health security is the fundamental crisis of climate change, which is another defining challenge of our generation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S079",
            "quote": "Developing countries contribute minimally to global emissions, yet bear the brunt of droughts, floods, shifting weather patterns, and climate-induced shocks."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S080",
            "quote": "Therefore, climate action must be accompanied by climate justice."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S081",
            "quote": "We call for stronger international cooperation in climate adaptation, resilience, technology transfer, capacity building, and access to predictable, affordable climate finance."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S082",
            "quote": "We must protect our environment not only for our present generation, but for those yet unborn."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S083",
            "quote": "In our region, we are currently confronted by what has been predicted as one of the most severe El Niño weather patterns on record."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S084",
            "quote": "Addressing this requires us to draw deeply upon strained national resources to protect our people and preserve their livelihoods."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S085",
            "quote": "Directly linked to climate resilience is our commitment to food security."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S086",
            "quote": "Our national objective is to ensure that every family has access to sufficient, safe, and nutritious food."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S087",
            "quote": "This is a matter of basic human dignity and sustainable development."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S088",
            "quote": "To achieve this, we are intensifying investment in agriculture, modern farming technologies, research, infrastructure, and the empowerment of our smallholder farmers."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S089",
            "quote": "We continue to provide subsidies for farming inputs and implements to support subsistence farmers."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S090",
            "quote": "Furthermore, we have embarked on major dam construction projects for irrigation, which are set to transform our agricultural landscape, particularly in the lowveld."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Taiwan and UN presence",
        "text": "Called for arrangements enabling Taiwan’s substantive participation in UN meetings and activities. Reaffirmed support for a continuing UN presence in Eswatini, including a permanent UN home.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S091",
            "quote": "National endeavours such as this are greatly enhanced by international cooperation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S092",
            "quote": "The partnership between the United Nations and the Kingdom of Eswatini has been instrumental in advancing our national development aspirations and implementing the SDGs."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S093",
            "quote": "This collaboration spans critical sectors, including health, tourism, education, agriculture, and renewable energy."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S094",
            "quote": "We deeply value this partnership and remain committed to ensuring a strong and enduring United Nations presence in our country, including the establishment of a permanent UN home in Eswatini."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S095",
            "quote": "Just as partnerships at home are vital, so is inclusive participation on the international stage."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S096",
            "quote": "Taiwan plays a vital role in global supply chains."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S097",
            "quote": "It has much to contribute to the international community and can play a highly meaningful role in building a sustainable future for humanity."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S098",
            "quote": "The United Nations should seek appropriate ways to facilitate Taiwan's substantive participation in UN meetings and activities, enabling it to share its expertise and actively engage with international partners."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
