        "text": "Supported a two-state solution, consolidation of the Gaza truce, unobstructed aid, and Hamas disarmament. Highlighted Gaza assistance, Rome-hosted Lebanon negotiations, UNIFIL, and continued support for Lebanon after the mission’s mandate ends.",
        "evidence": [
