  "LVA": {
    "bullets": [
      {
        "label": "Ukraine",
        "text": "Condemned Russia’s invasion and attacks on civilians, called for an immediate full ceasefire and Russian withdrawal, and sought accountability and a just peace. Prioritized the return of Ukrainian children and thanked Melania Trump’s efforts on their behalf.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S055",
            "quote": "These principles are now being tested in Ukraine."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S056",
            "quote": "Russia's war against Ukraine strikes at the very heart of the United Nations Charter."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S057",
            "quote": "Borders changed by force, territory seized by force, children taken by force, Ukrainian civilians targeted by Russia: schools, hospitals, homes, markets, energy infrastructure."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S058",
            "quote": "Russia's attacks reach far beyond the battlefield."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S059",
            "quote": "They are directed against the people of Ukraine and the foundations of their daily lives."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S060",
            "quote": "Drones are used to hunt civilians."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S061",
            "quote": "Human lives are treated like targets in a safari."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S062",
            "quote": "These are not policy disagreements."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S063",
            "quote": "These are grave violations of international law."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S064",
            "quote": "And where crimes are committed, there must be accountability."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S065",
            "quote": "Let us not look away."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S066",
            "quote": "Russia is a permanent member of the Security Council."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S067",
            "quote": "With that comes a special responsibility for international peace and security."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S068",
            "quote": "Instead, Russia is violating the very principles it is entrusted to uphold."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S069",
            "quote": "Russia started this brutal war."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S070",
            "quote": "Russia can end it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S071",
            "quote": "It can stop its attacks."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S072",
            "quote": "It can withdraw its forces."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S073",
            "quote": "It can leave Ukraine's sovereign territory."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S074",
            "quote": "Latvia continues to call for an immediate and full ceasefire."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S075",
            "quote": "Ukraine deserves just peace."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S109",
            "quote": "At the core are real people."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S110",
            "quote": "That is why Latvia will continue to do everything possible to help return Ukrainian children deported to Russia."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S111",
            "quote": "Those children have been taken from their families, their communities, and their country."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S112",
            "quote": "We know such stories from the darkest chapters of history."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S113",
            "quote": "Today, those things are happening again."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S114",
            "quote": "We support every genuine effort to secure the return of Ukrainian children."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S115",
            "quote": "We are very grateful to the First Lady of the United States, Melania Trump, and her efforts to help bring those children home."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S116",
            "quote": "These children need to come home now."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Hybrid threats",
        "text": "Described the exploitation of migrants at the Belarus border, cyberattacks, sabotage, airspace violations, and Russia’s shadow fleet as threats requiring collective attention rather than treatment as lesser security issues.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S076",
            "quote": "Members of the United Nations, not every attack on the international order looks like war."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S077",
            "quote": "Drones carrying explosives at airports, drones crashing into homes, airspace violated, critical infrastructure damaged, power stations suddenly in flames, cyberattacks."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S078",
            "quote": "We sometimes call them hybrid threats."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S079",
            "quote": "But it sounds as innocent as hybrid cars."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S080",
            "quote": "In reality, those threats to international peace and security are as dangerous as conventional wars."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S081",
            "quote": "Guarding the eastern border of NATO and the European Union, Latvia faces these threats every day."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S082",
            "quote": "Illegal migrants are deliberately exploited and pushed towards our border with Belarus."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S083",
            "quote": "Cyberattacks target our critical networks."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S084",
            "quote": "Acts of sabotage seek to create fear and instability in our societies."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S085",
            "quote": "Russia's shadow fleet exploits legal gray zones and puts our security and environment at risk."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S086",
            "quote": "Even in this very building, at the Security Council table, we have heard Russia spread blatant lies and make threats against Latvia and other free and democratic countries."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "UN reform and leadership",
        "text": "Supported UN80 and an expanded, more representative Security Council. Said the next Secretary-General should defend the Charter and international law.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S087",
            "quote": "Distinguished delegates, that brings us back to a fundamental question: what is the United Nations' role if its members are threatened and if its principles are violated?"
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S088",
            "quote": "The United Nations cannot take its relevance for granted."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S089",
            "quote": "It must earn it, day by day."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S090",
            "quote": "Not through the number of meetings we hold, not through the number of resolutions we adopt, but through real and tangible results."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S091",
            "quote": "The United Nations must prove that it can still make a difference when it matters most."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S092",
            "quote": "That requires institutions that work."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S093",
            "quote": "Latvia supports the Secretary-General's UN80 initiative."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S094",
            "quote": "Reform is not about weakening the United Nations."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S095",
            "quote": "It is about making it stronger, more focused, and better able to deliver on its mandate."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S096",
            "quote": "That must also include the Security Council."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S097",
            "quote": "Its composition must better reflect the world of today, not the world of 1945."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S098",
            "quote": "Latvia supports an expanded and more representative Security Council."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S099",
            "quote": "Excellencies, reform is also about leadership."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S100",
            "quote": "This year, we will select the next Secretary-General."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S101",
            "quote": "The choice matters."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S102",
            "quote": "The next Secretary-General must defend the Charter with conviction."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S103",
            "quote": "He must, or she must, uphold international law."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S104",
            "quote": "That is what true leadership means: to speak up for the weak against the powerful."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S105",
            "quote": "That is what true leadership means."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "UN engagement",
        "text": "Highlighted Latvia’s stated November Council presidency, advocacy for smaller states, and protection of survivors of conflict-related sexual violence. Linked these priorities to its Human Rights Council bid in the 2028 elections.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S106",
            "quote": "Dear colleagues, Latvia now serves as an elected member of the Security Council, and we will hold our presidency in November."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S107",
            "quote": "Latvia came to the Council with a simple promise: to stand up for international order, to speak clearly when it is violated, and to make the voices of smaller nations heard."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S108",
            "quote": "That reflects who Latvia is, and that reflects what Latvia believes in."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S109",
