  "MNE": {
    "bullets": [
      {
        "label": "European integration",
        "text": "Set EU membership by 2028 as Montenegro’s goal, not an assured outcome. Reaffirmed NATO and EU foreign-policy alignment, regional cooperation, and reconciliation based on international court judgments and equal recognition of victims.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S020",
            "quote": "Excellencies, 20 years ago, shortly after peacefully restoring our independence, Montenegro took its seat in this very Assembly as a full member of the United Nations."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S021",
            "quote": "This year, therefore, holds a very special significance for us."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S022",
            "quote": "We celebrate 20 years of our UN membership as a sovereign nation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S023",
            "quote": "A child born in Montenegro that year is now 20 years old."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S024",
            "quote": "A generation has come of age, witnessing Montenegro's transformation from a newly independent state into a country helping shape the Balkans, defined not by the conflicts of the past, but by the opportunities of the future."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S025",
            "quote": "On the geostrategic front, Montenegro has paved the path towards our future in the European Union, which is now within our reach."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S026",
            "quote": "Our goal is very clear: by 2028, to see Montenegro's flag stand among the member states of the European Union."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S027",
            "quote": "In 2017, Montenegro joined NATO, strengthening not only our own security, but also contributing to the stability of our entire region."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S028",
            "quote": "We have kept good relations with our neighbors and demonstrated that a multi-ethnic, multi-religious, and multicultural society can turn diversity into confidence, belonging, and common purpose."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S029",
            "quote": "At home, we have transformed our economy and strengthened the democratic institutions on which lasting prosperity depends."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S030",
            "quote": "Much work remains ahead of us, but the foundations have been laid for a society in which talent and effort open doors, and a country where young people can imagine their future at home."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S031",
            "quote": "For us, the European Union is not simply a destination we wish to reach, but a value-based journey that we have embarked on."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S032",
            "quote": "When the European perspective of the Balkans was reaffirmed at the Thessaloniki Summit in 2003, the world looked very different."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S033",
            "quote": "Multilateralism and international cooperation were expanding back then."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S034",
            "quote": "The European Union was one of the most attractive political projects in the world and would welcome 13 new member states over the following decade."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S035",
            "quote": "At the same time, the Balkans was still emerging from the devastation and divisions of the '90s."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S036",
            "quote": "More than two decades later, we live in a profoundly different international environment."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S037",
            "quote": "The international order is entering a new and uncertain phase."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S038",
            "quote": "This is why enlargement of the European Union is an act of strategic foresight."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S039",
            "quote": "It is one of the best investments Europe can make in peace, security, and long-term stability."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S040",
            "quote": "Montenegro is proud to stand today at the forefront of that process, ready to serve as an example for other countries."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S041",
            "quote": "Not because our journey has been without difficulties, but because our journey demonstrates something essential: that progress is possible, that reforms matter, and that democratic political culture pays off."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S042",
            "quote": "Earlier this year, leaders from across Europe gathered in Montenegro for the European Union-Western Balkans Summit."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S043",
            "quote": "For Montenegro, that gathering carried a meaning far beyond protocol."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S044",
            "quote": "It demonstrated how far our country has traveled and how close our European future has become."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S045",
            "quote": "It also sent an important message about our region: that the future of the entire Balkan region lies within the European Union."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S046",
            "quote": "Our region has carried the weight of division for too long, and a new chapter is being written through cooperation, connectivity, economic opportunity, and economic integration."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S047",
            "quote": "My generation has a responsibility to help complete that chapter."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S048",
            "quote": "These responsibilities are not important because of the titles they carry."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S049",
            "quote": "They are important because of what they allow us to contribute to reconciliation, connectivity, democratic resilience, and the European future of our region."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S050",
            "quote": "Lasting reconciliation cannot be built on denial, selective approaches to justice, or the glorification of those convicted of war crimes."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S051",
            "quote": "It requires respect for the judgments of international courts and equal dignity for every single victim, regardless of their identity or background."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S052",
            "quote": "In a world searching for proof that cooperation still works, Montenegro is contributing to the vision that the Balkans become that proof."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S053",
            "quote": "Excellencies, the principles that guide us at home guide us here as well, in this very organization."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S054",
            "quote": "Our engagement with the United Nations system is guided by the same principles."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S055",
            "quote": "Montenegro is a reliable, credible, and predictable partner, committed to an effective multilateral system with the UN Charter at its core, aligned with the European Union's Common Foreign and Security Policy, and working closely with our NATO Allies and EU partners in support of international peace and security."
          }
        ]
