      {
        "label": "Taiwan and navigation",
        "text": "Reaffirmed support for Taiwan’s full and meaningful participation in the UN and specialized agencies. Warned about Taiwan Strait tensions and called for an end to attacks, reopened navigation through Hormuz and Bab al-Mandab, and negotiations.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S063",
            "quote": "Of course, problems are not confined to my region."
          },
