            "sentence_id": "S064",
            "quote": "There are problems all around the world."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S065",
            "quote": "Paraguay is noting with deep concern what is happening in the Persian Gulf when the Strait of Hormuz is closed."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S066",
            "quote": "It is not the great powers or the wealthiest who pay the price."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S067",
            "quote": "It is the least protected who pay the price, the most vulnerable among our citizens."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S068",
            "quote": "The food and energy security of millions of people depends on keeping that passage open."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S069",
            "quote": "Therefore, today I make an urgent appeal for the immediate cessation of attacks, for the full reopening of and freedom of navigation through the Straits of Hormuz and Bab al-Mandab, and a return to negotiations."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S070",
            "quote": "Human dignity, dear friends, does not change when we move from one continent to another."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S071",
            "quote": "It is always the same."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S072",
            "quote": "And it is that human dignity that must guide not only our words, but also our actions."
