            "quote": "The stakes of this potential conflict could scarcely be higher."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S082",
            "quote": "The very future of humanity is at stake."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S083",
            "quote": "And I want to make one thing clear here."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S084",
            "quote": "Paraguay is not neutral on this issue."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S085",
            "quote": "Paraguay stands, and I say this loud and clear, with Taiwan."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S086",
            "quote": "Not out of expediency, quite the opposite."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S087",
            "quote": "We stand with Taiwan because of the profound values we share: democracy, the rule of law, human rights, and peace."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S088",
            "quote": "Seventy years of uninterrupted diplomatic relations are not merely a number or the product of a mere calculation."
