      {
        "label": "Technology and values",
        "text": "Called for AI to serve human dignity, democratic accountability, freedom, and equality before the law. Reaffirmed protection of life from conception and the family; highlighted reported economic gains and renewable electricity as a basis for investment.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S012",
            "quote": "Paraguay comes before the community of nations with one non-negotiable conviction: the dignity of the human person must be at the heart of every decision."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S013",
            "quote": "For this reason, we defend freedom, democracy, the sovereignty of states, respect for human rights, and the peaceful settlement of disputes."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S014",
            "quote": "For this reason, we uphold human life from conception and we recognize the family as the fundamental unit of our society."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S015",
            "quote": "Because when human dignity is forgotten, humanity itself disappears."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S016",
            "quote": "Human dignity, from conception until the end of life, is the foundation of our presence on this earth."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S127",
            "quote": "This Assembly also calls on us to manage transformation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S128",
            "quote": "No one here needs me to tell them what the great transformation of our age is."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S129",
            "quote": "Every great era in human history has had its driving force."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S130",
            "quote": "Steam powered the Industrial Revolution."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S131",
            "quote": "The transistor powered the digital age."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S132",
            "quote": "No force in our time is as profound as artificial intelligence."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S133",
            "quote": "We can already see its power in warfare, in the economy, and in our everyday lives."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S134",
            "quote": "Unlike tools that merely transmitted what we said, these systems are part and parcel of the decisions that we make."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S135",
            "quote": "The potential is immense."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S136",
            "quote": "Paraguay today feeds 100 million people, and with this tool, it could feed 1 billion."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S137",
            "quote": "It could enable us to cover in years distances that once took generations."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S138",
            "quote": "This transformation cannot be held back, and no one should be left out of it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S139",
            "quote": "However, we're not blind to the risks, but we cannot allow fear to guide us."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S140",
            "quote": "Like a child, artificial intelligence repeats what it has learned from those who trained it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S141",
            "quote": "If it has learned to deny freedom, then that lesson will not arrive in the form of a law that we can debate."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S142",
            "quote": "It will arrive covertly in some minor task, in some action that no one regards as a decision."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S143",
            "quote": "Democracy endures provided that the decisions that govern us can be traced back to the will of those who must live with their consequences."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S144",
            "quote": "When that thread is severed, the will of the people risks being replaced without ever having been defeated."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S145",
            "quote": "Protecting that delicate thread doesn't mean forgoing the benefits."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S146",
            "quote": "It means refusing to ignore the risk that truly matters."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S147",
            "quote": "Artificial intelligence must serve human dignity and not replace it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S148",
            "quote": "As His Holiness the Pope reminds us in the recent encyclical Magnifica Humanitas, the values embedded in these systems are not technical constraints; they are a choice made by those who train them."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S149",
            "quote": "The future demands that the choice be freedom, democracy, and equality before the law, and that those who make that choice be held accountable for it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S173",
            "quote": "Today, Paraguay is experiencing one of the finest economic periods in its history, and it has become an example to other countries of macroeconomic stability, sustained growth, and poverty reduction."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S174",
            "quote": "As a result, in December 2025, Standard & Poor's awarded us our second investment-grade rating, making Paraguay the first country in more than a decade to achieve that distinction."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S175",
            "quote": "In the final quarter of that year, unemployment fell to 3.6%."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S176",
            "quote": "This is the lowest level in our records."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S177",
            "quote": "Growth only matters if it is felt at home."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S178",
            "quote": "Decent employment is one of the best social policies a state can provide."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S179",
            "quote": "And that's not all."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S180",
            "quote": "Paraguay has reduced poverty to levels never seen before."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S181",
            "quote": "In less than 20 years, we have brought the poverty rate down from 58% to 16%, faster than any other country in the region."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S182",
            "quote": "Because people matter to us."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S183",
            "quote": "Moreover, the future is bright, not only because our electricity supply is abundant, stable, and 100% renewable, but also because our region possesses land, energy, critical minerals, and, most importantly, extraordinary people."
          }
        ]
      }
