  "SVK": {
    "bullets": [
      {
        "label": "Council candidacy and reform",
        "text": "Sought support for Slovakia’s 2028–2029 Council bid, with priorities covering international law, accountable security institutions, strategic resources and infrastructure, and digital/AI security. Supported UN80, the Pact for the Future, and greater representation for underrepresented regions.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S022",
            "quote": "Slovakia is firmly anchored in the United Nations, NATO, and the European Union."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S023",
            "quote": "We believe in cooperation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S024",
            "quote": "But we also believe that institutions must produce real results."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S025",
            "quote": "Over the past year, Slovakia has hosted several international meetings and offered space for dialogue."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S026",
            "quote": "Where we can be useful, we are ready to help bring parties together and to support diplomacy within the UN framework."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S027",
            "quote": "Because when diplomacy stops, confrontation fills the space."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S028",
            "quote": "That is why, when we speak about the United Nations, I believe in evolution rather than revolution."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S029",
            "quote": "The world has changed, and the United Nations must change with it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S030",
            "quote": "The Security Council should better reflect today’s realities and give a stronger voice to countries and regions that are still underrepresented."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S031",
            "quote": "Countries from the region often understand a crisis best."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S032",
            "quote": "Giving them a stronger voice can help us act earlier and prevent escalation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S033",
            "quote": "Slovakia sees its engagement in UN reform as part of its responsibility to this organization, including through UN80 and the implementation of the Pact for the Future."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S034",
            "quote": "Our responsibility to the wider international order is also reflected in our candidacy for the Security Council for 2028 and 2029."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S035",
            "quote": "We would, of course, be grateful for your trust and support."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S036",
            "quote": "If elected, Slovakia will focus on four priorities: international law and the UN Charter, accountable security institutions, the protection of strategic resources and critical infrastructure, and the security challenges linked to digitalization and artificial intelligence."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "AI and autonomous weapons",
        "text": "Called for equitable AI access and strong international frameworks for autonomous weapons, with the UN in a leading role. Insisted that machines should not independently make life-or-death decisions.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S037",
            "quote": "I fully share the concern of the United Nations about the inequalities that can be created by unequal access to artificial intelligence."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S038",
            "quote": "It is in our common interest that innovation benefits all of humanity, not only the strongest economies or the biggest companies."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S039",
            "quote": "If AI is available only to a few, new divisions will appear."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S040",
            "quote": "Entire communities may be left behind."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S041",
            "quote": "The growing use of AI-powered weapons and autonomous systems also requires urgent attention."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S042",
            "quote": "One principle must remain clear: machines should never be allowed to make life-or-death decisions on their own."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S043",
            "quote": "Just as the international community developed rules for nuclear, chemical, and biological weapons, we also need strong international frameworks for these new technologies."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S044",
            "quote": "The United Nations can and should play a leading role in this effort."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Prevention and diplomacy",
        "text": "Supported responsible AI use for mediation, analysis, and early warning under human oversight. Rejected changing borders by force and backed serious diplomatic efforts to end Russia’s war against Ukraine.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S050",
            "quote": "At the same time, we should not see AI only as a risk."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S051",
            "quote": "It can also be a tool for peace."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S052",
            "quote": "It can help us analyze information, identify patterns, and overcome language barriers in real time."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S053",
            "quote": "It can support better decisions, faster responses, and more effective prevention."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S054",
            "quote": "With responsible use, proper human oversight, and good governance, we can move this technology away from the battlefield and towards diplomacy, mediation, and conflict prevention."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S055",
            "quote": "And prevention matters."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S056",
            "quote": "Every conflict we prevent saves lives."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S057",
            "quote": "It protects development."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S058",
            "quote": "It preserves human dignity."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S059",
            "quote": "Once violence begins, every solution becomes harder, more costly, and more painful."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S060",
            "quote": "There is no need to reinvent the wheel when we reform international institutions."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S061",
            "quote": "AI may be revolutionary."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S062",
            "quote": "But we did not need to reinvent the personal computer in order to build it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S063",
            "quote": "The same is true in global politics."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S064",
            "quote": "We should improve what already exists, not start again from zero."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S065",
            "quote": "But let’s ask ourselves a simple question."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S066",
            "quote": "What if we, as world leaders, were to start again following the UN Charter?"
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S067",
            "quote": "Would reform even matter if we finally did our best for global peace?"
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S068",
            "quote": "Too many conflicts are still driven by the belief that political problems can be solved by force, by changing borders, violating sovereignty, and ignoring international rules."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S069",
            "quote": "We need to reject this logic."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S078",
            "quote": "That is why our most urgent task must be clear: stop the violence, keep diplomacy alive, and prevent today’s conflicts from becoming tomorrow’s normal."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S079",
            "quote": "The war in Ukraine, now in its fifth year, continues to bring destruction close to Slovakia’s borders."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S080",
            "quote": "Attacks on civilian areas and critical infrastructure remain unacceptable."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S081",
            "quote": "A ceasefire is still distant, and lasting peace even further away."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S082",
            "quote": "We should support every serious diplomatic effort that can help end Russia’s war against Ukraine and build a safe future for our neighbor."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Humanitarian priorities and leadership",
        "text": "Called for aid access and civilian protection in Gaza, a negotiated two-state solution, and attention to Sudan. Supported a transparent, inclusive Secretary-General selection based on merit, regional diversity, and gender balance.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S083",
            "quote": "Our commitment to international law and human dignity cannot stop at Europe’s borders."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S084",
            "quote": "The same basic principles must guide us in the Middle East."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S085",
            "quote": "International humanitarian law must be respected."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S086",
            "quote": "Civilians must be protected."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S087",
            "quote": "Humanitarian aid must reach those who need it, including in Gaza."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S088",
            "quote": "There can be no justification for terrorism, anti-Semitism, anti-Muslim hatred, or calls to violence."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S089",
            "quote": "Israelis and Palestinians both deserve to live in security and dignity."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S090",
            "quote": "And Slovakia continues to support a negotiated two-state solution with Israel and an independent Palestinian state living side by side in peace and security."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S091",
            "quote": "Other conflicts that are currently out of the spotlight must not escape our attention and our efforts to solve them."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S092",
            "quote": "Take, for example, the civil war in Sudan that has triggered the world’s largest humanitarian crisis."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S100",
            "quote": "This year, the United Nations will choose its next Secretary-General."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S101",
            "quote": "Slovakia supports a transparent and inclusive process based on merit, with due regard to regional diversity and gender balance."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S102",
            "quote": "And I would also like to thank Secretary-General Antonio Guterres for his dedicated service and leadership during these difficult years."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S103",
            "quote": "The next Secretary-General will inherit an organization under serious security, geopolitical, institutional, and financial pressure."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S104",
            "quote": "But the future of the United Nations will not depend on one person alone."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S105",
            "quote": "It depends on all of us, on our will, courage, and determination."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
