  "UKR": {
    "bullets": [
      {
        "label": "Pressure on Russia",
        "text": "Urged continued sanctions, reduced trade with Russia, defense assistance, and joint production to limit Russia’s war financing. Described Ukrainian strikes as directed at the resources sustaining the war; battlefield and economic assessments were the speaker’s claims.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S064",
            "quote": "Ladies and gentlemen, last year, speaking here, I said that we are living in a time when weapons decide who survives."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S065",
            "quote": "And I said that if a nation wants peace, it must work on strong weapons."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S066",
            "quote": "Ukraine is doing exactly that."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S067",
            "quote": "And this is why, for the first time in Russia's history, we now hear that its pride, its oil industry, is running on fumes."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S068",
            "quote": "But oil itself is not Ukraine's target, not our target; not gasoline or diesel, not factories or ports as such."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S069",
            "quote": "Our target is Russia's ability to finance this war, to drag it out, to make it more brutal and more destructive."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S070",
            "quote": "Russia's finances and Russia's production are what must be stopped if Putin is to be stopped."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S071",
            "quote": "And our great soldiers and our weapons are working for this, only for this."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S072",
            "quote": "The world's support for Ukraine helps us do it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S073",
            "quote": "And I am grateful to everyone, to every country that stands with us, stands with Ukraine, and helps our people."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S074",
            "quote": "Sanctions, support packages, and our joint weapons production all matter."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S075",
            "quote": "All of this makes us stronger."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S076",
            "quote": "When someone gives Russia more money through trade, they give this war more time."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S077",
            "quote": "That is exactly why we insist on limiting trade with the aggressor and why we are burning Russia's revenues ourselves."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S078",
            "quote": "Many of you here have seen more than once how the abuse of the veto at the UN weakens the world and pushes peace further away."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S079",
            "quote": "When Russia has money, it always says no: no to diplomacy."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S080",
            "quote": "And this is also a kind of veto on peace, not an official right, but a real one."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S081",
            "quote": "And when someone in the world weakens sanctions against Russian oligarchs, it may make life more comfortable for rich Russians, but it also gives the war more time, more time for Putin to send poor people into the kill zone."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S082",
            "quote": "So Russia's revenues must remain a target."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S083",
            "quote": "Russia's budget deficit is now bigger than in any other year, and most Russian regions are already bankrupt."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S084",
            "quote": "Russia planned major operations on the front this summer."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S085",
            "quote": "All of them failed."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S086",
            "quote": "Russia's bet on cruise missiles and Shaheds did not work the way Putin planned."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S087",
            "quote": "They still cause damage, but they did not break us."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S088",
            "quote": "We built our defense."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S089",
            "quote": "What is truly difficult for us now are Russian ballistic missiles and their new jet-powered Shaheds."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Defense partnerships",
        "text": "Invited countries to join the FREIA anti-ballistic program as a lower-cost, scalable complement—not replacement—for Patriot and SAMP-T systems. Promoted integrated drone-defense partnerships for infrastructure and borders, reporting new agreements with Finland and Australia.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S098",
            "quote": "Ukraine's soldiers have already successfully tested four new jet-powered interceptor drones against Russian jet-powered Shaheds."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S099",
            "quote": "So we are scaling up production, and we will build protection against the threat too."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S100",
            "quote": "We have also launched an anti-ballistic program, FREIA, together with our partners."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S101",
            "quote": "Ten countries are already part of it: Ukraine, Norway, Sweden, Denmark, Germany, France, Italy, the United Kingdom, Spain, and the Netherlands."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S102",
            "quote": "Last week, I invited Poland to join."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S103",
            "quote": "And we are also in consultations with a couple of other Allied governments who want to join FREIA."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S104",
            "quote": "We remain open to every country that can contribute to building protection against ballistic missiles."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S105",
            "quote": "Our FREIA program does not replace proven and effective systems, such as Patriot systems or upgraded anti-ballistic SAMP-T systems."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S106",
            "quote": "We want to build a system that can be produced on a much larger scale and at a lower cost, a system that can become an integrated part of Ukraine's defense and Europe's defense, one that can help any freedom-loving nation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S107",
            "quote": "The global waiting list for anti-ballistic systems is very long."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S108",
            "quote": "There are more and more ballistic threats, and the industrial capacity of those who choose war is very large."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S109",
            "quote": "So we need to produce enough protection so that every person sitting in this hall can say, \"My people are truly protected.\" That is our approach to security."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S110",
            "quote": "Today, even the richest countries in the world cannot find enough missile interceptors."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S111",
            "quote": "Current production is simply not enough, and even those who spent years building up interceptor stocks have already used a large part of them."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S112",
            "quote": "Unfortunately, this is the reality, even in the Gulf, where countries really worked to build strong anti-ballistic defense."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S113",
            "quote": "So we need a new program."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S114",
            "quote": "We need FREIA."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S115",
            "quote": "Join these common efforts."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S131",
            "quote": "We also have the drone deal format."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S132",
            "quote": "This is not simply about selling drones."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S133",
            "quote": "It is cooperation with other countries to build a modern, integrated defense system against drone threats in the air, at sea, and on land."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S134",
            "quote": "And this is not only about protecting the sky."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S135",
            "quote": "Drones help us control our borders, mountain areas, and, of course, roads."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S136",
            "quote": "Without them, this would simply be impossible."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S137",
            "quote": "It is also about protecting critical infrastructure, about resilience, and about organizing resources and defense forces so that critical infrastructure and transport can keep working even in the most difficult conditions."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S138",
            "quote": "This is also part of the deals we offer."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S139",
            "quote": "These are ready-made security formats that we adapt to each specific country and each specific region."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S140",
            "quote": "We are already working with partners in the Gulf, the South Caucasus, and across Europe through drone deals."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S141",
            "quote": "Today, I signed a serious drone deal with Finland, and this is significant."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S142",
            "quote": "Also today, I signed a security agreement with Australia, and drones are part of it too."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S143",
            "quote": "And we are preparing drone deals with Canada and with other countries as well."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S144",
            "quote": "When Russia started this war, it could never have imagined that Ukrainian long-range drones would one day reach its factories, its military factories, somewhere in Siberia and on the Yamal Peninsula, thousands of kilometers from our borders."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S145",
            "quote": "No Russian admiral expected that we would be able to sink Russia's pride, cruisers that were supposed to dominate the sea but could not survive our naval drones."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S146",
            "quote": "Along with different types of drones, we also produce a wide range of conventional weapons quickly, at lower cost than in many other countries, and tested in modern war."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S147",
            "quote": "Ukraine is building its security so that we reinforce our role as a real provider of security and help others get the protection that has already worked for us and that can truly reduce the space for starting and spreading wars in the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Winter and AI risks",
        "text": "Called for diplomacy backed by strength and de-escalation before winter to protect energy infrastructure. Sought greater Chinese influence on Russia and warned that expanding AI-enabled battlefield decision-making adds urgency to ending the war.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S149",
            "quote": "Ladies and gentlemen, just think about it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S150",
            "quote": "No Russian official ever imagined that General Winter, which had fought on Russia's side for centuries, would one day switch sides and support those defending themselves from Russia."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S151",
            "quote": "We will make that happen this winter if Russia continues to target our energy system and our heating."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S152",
            "quote": "Ukrainians understand that this winter could be very harsh for us, but in response, we will have no choice but to make it painful for Russia too."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S153",
            "quote": "And that is exactly why we say that de-escalation steps are important and needed before winter, now."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S154",
            "quote": "We need diplomacy, and we need strength."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S155",
            "quote": "And step by step, we are closing the gaps in both."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S156",
            "quote": "Yesterday, we met with the president of the United States, and this is exactly what we discussed."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S157",
            "quote": "Unfortunately, we have not had a chance to speak directly with the leader of China, who is in America today, but not here."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S158",
            "quote": "And he is someone who can influence Russia too, more than many others can."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S159",
            "quote": "We would like him to want peace as much as we do in Ukraine."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S160",
            "quote": "We believe the world has the power to make this happen."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S161",
            "quote": "We are sure the world needs this."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S162",
            "quote": "This is about energy, about critical infrastructure."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S163",
            "quote": "This is about food security."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S164",
            "quote": "This is about the lives of many, many people in many countries."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S165",
            "quote": "And this is about finally slowing down the rapid development of weapons for killing, a process that has continued throughout this war and has already become a global threat."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S166",
            "quote": "And this is about finally slowing down the rapid development of weapons for killing, a process that has continued throughout this war and has already become a global threat."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S167",
            "quote": "We need to slow it down before we reach the next stage, because as early as next year, there is already a real possibility that AI, not only people, will begin to decide what happens on the battlefield."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S168",
            "quote": "And we need peace before we reach that point."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Foreign recruitment",
        "text": "Said Russia was using citizens of 47 countries in the war and urged affected governments to protect their nationals from recruitment or deception. Also warned of wider security consequences from Russian–North Korean military cooperation.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S026",
            "quote": "His comrade, the leader of North Korea, sent his troops to Russia to support the weak points of the Russian army."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S027",
            "quote": "The North Koreans also suffered losses, heavy losses."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S028",
            "quote": "You probably saw the broadcast from Pyongyang when they honored those who were killed."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S029",
            "quote": "And this is madness too."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S030",
            "quote": "Why should Koreans give their lives in a war against Ukraine?"
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S031",
            "quote": "Kim Jong-un uses them like currency, and he gets something in return."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S032",
            "quote": "North Korea's neighbors and countries across Asia have probably already noticed its improved ballistic missiles and Pyongyang's much greater drone capabilities."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S033",
            "quote": "A war that was not prevented in time, was not stopped in time, and for which Russia was not punished in time, keeps spreading and spreads evil with it."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S178",
            "quote": "And one more thing."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S179",
            "quote": "For weeks now, Europeans have warned that Russia may go further into Europe, even into NATO territory."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S180",
            "quote": "Leaders have intelligence showing Russian intentions."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S181",
            "quote": "And right now, I want to speak not to Europe."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S182",
            "quote": "I want to speak to those countries whose people Russia may try to use in another absolutely brutal campaign."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S183",
            "quote": "We have had more than just North Korean POWs."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S184",
            "quote": "We know that Russia uses citizens of 47 countries in this war: Ghana, Nepal, Tajikistan, India, Yemen, Kenya, Zimbabwe, Cuba, Belarus, Sudan, South Africa, and many, many others."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S185",
            "quote": "And from time to time, we receive requests to send particular POWs back home."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S186",
            "quote": "Through the videos from our drones, we also see people dying on the battlefield who are not Russians, people from your countries, 47 countries who ended up in Russia through deception and tricks."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S187",
            "quote": "So I want to speak directly to every representative of these 47 countries."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S188",
            "quote": "You know what Russia is doing with your people, your citizens."
          },
          {
