  "UZB": {
    "bullets": [
      {
        "label": "UN engagement",
        "text": "Supported UN80 and Council expansion, sought support for Uzbekistan’s 2035–2036 non-permanent Council bid, and said it would assume the NAM chairmanship in 2027 to promote dialogue.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S020",
            "quote": "Esteemed delegates, today, no nation, however powerful, can address all global problems alone."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S021",
            "quote": "None of the threats stop at national borders."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S022",
            "quote": "That is why we need the United Nations more than ever."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S023",
            "quote": "We need a United Nations capable of implementing decisions, not just making them."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S024",
            "quote": "We need a United Nations where the voices of every country are heard."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S025",
            "quote": "Uzbekistan supports the UN Secretary-General's efforts within the framework of the UN80 initiative aimed at adapting the organization to modern requirements."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S026",
            "quote": "We support expanding the composition of the UN Security Council based on modern realities."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S027",
            "quote": "Next year, Uzbekistan will take up the chairmanship of the Non-Aligned Movement."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S028",
            "quote": "At a time of escalating tensions, we take this as a responsibility to create new platforms for dialogue."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S029",
            "quote": "In that spirit, Uzbekistan has offered its candidacy for non-permanent membership in the Security Council for 2035 and 2036."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S030",
            "quote": "We count on your support."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S031",
            "quote": "For us, international law is not an instrument that changes based on interests."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S032",
            "quote": "It is a common rule for all countries."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S033",
            "quote": "There cannot be universal justice without universal law."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Regional diplomacy and human capital",
        "text": "Highlighted improved Central Asian cooperation and called for constructive engagement with Afghanistan rather than isolation. Announced a forthcoming UNFPA dialogue on demographic stability and human capital and an October gathering in Samarkand on children’s well-being.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S034",
            "quote": "Ladies and gentlemen, until recently, Central Asia was often mentioned against the backdrop of unresolved border disputes, water resource management issues, and many other conflicts."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S035",
            "quote": "Thanks to the initiative of the President of Uzbekistan and the political will of the Central Asian heads of state, the situation and atmosphere in the region have completely changed."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S036",
            "quote": "We began to view each other as partners, not sources of threat."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S037",
            "quote": "The same is true of President Shavkat Mirziyoyev's approach to the Afghan issue."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S038",
            "quote": "Viewing Afghanistan solely as a source of danger will not solve the problem, nor is it a way out to leave the multi-ethnic Afghan people alone with their problems."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S039",
            "quote": "They must be given hope and confidence to achieve a peaceful life."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S050",
            "quote": "A child is the state's greatest responsibility."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S051",
            "quote": "If a child is not born healthy and does not receive a quality education, we put the future of not just one person, but the entire society at risk."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S052",
            "quote": "In the coming days, we will hold a high-level dialogue with the United Nations Population Fund on issues of demographic stability and human capital."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S053",
            "quote": "And in October, we will bring together the international community in Samarkand around the issues of children's well-being."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Water and energy",
        "text": "Promoted Aral Sea restoration, water-saving technologies, afforestation, and a target of 54% renewable energy by 2030. Urged practical implementation of the announced 2027–2036 afforestation and reforestation decade.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S054",
            "quote": "Ladies and gentlemen, Central Asia has another lesson that it can offer the whole world."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S055",
            "quote": "That is the Aral Sea."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S056",
            "quote": "It did not dry up due to a natural disaster."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S057",
            "quote": "This is a consequence of decades of wrong decisions and unjust treatment of nature."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S058",
            "quote": "New Uzbekistan is creating green areas on the dried seabed to reduce the scale of this problem."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S059",
            "quote": "We are introducing modern water-saving technologies."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S060",
            "quote": "We aim to increase the share of renewable energy to 54% by 2030."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S061",
            "quote": "We do not want the Aral Sea to remain merely a symbol of environmental tragedy."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S062",
            "quote": "It should become a testing ground for environmental solutions."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S063",
            "quote": "At the initiative of Uzbekistan, the United Nations General Assembly declared 2027–2036 the Decade of Action for Afforestation and Reforestation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S064",
            "quote": "The time has come to back this resolution with practical results."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "AI and legal reform",
        "text": "Called for AI governance rooted in human rights, security, equal opportunity, and accountability. Reported an English-law-based commercial court initiative, action against child and forced labor and domestic violence, support for women’s enterprise, and interreligious dialogue.",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "sentence_id": "S065",
            "quote": "Esteemed President, dear participants, today, humanity stands on the brink of another massive transformation."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S066",
            "quote": "I speak of artificial intelligence."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S067",
            "quote": "But one question remains unanswered: does technology serve humankind, or are we forced to adapt to technology?"
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S068",
            "quote": "However, the principle must be clear: humanity and its destiny must be at the heart of technological progress."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S069",
            "quote": "Artificial intelligence must be inseparable from human rights, security, equal opportunity, and accountability."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S070",
            "quote": "Technological progress should not force people to change, but rather serve to improve human life."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S071",
            "quote": "Uzbekistan advocates strengthening international dialogue in this regard."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S072",
            "quote": "Dear friends, power is not above the law."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S073",
            "quote": "Every person who turns to the court, regardless of who they are, must have faith that justice will prevail."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S074",
            "quote": "A separate international commercial court based on the principles of English law is being established at the Tashkent International Financial Center."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S075",
            "quote": "We have eradicated child labor and systemic forced labor."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S076",
            "quote": "We have tightened responsibility for domestic violence."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S077",
            "quote": "We also rely on this criterion when it comes to women's rights and opportunities."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S078",
            "quote": "Therefore, we have created a separate system to support women's entrepreneurship."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S079",
            "quote": "Today, women make up 39% of our parliament."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S080",
            "quote": "Esteemed heads of delegations, in Tashkent, the Islamic Civilization Center was built at the initiative of President Shavkat Mirziyoyev."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S081",
            "quote": "We see it not only as a place that showcases the past, but as a house of knowledge, thought, and enlightenment."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S082",
            "quote": "Today, in an era when social networks and artificial intelligence are spreading hatred and stereotypes at a rapid pace, it is important to remind this truth once again."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S083",
            "quote": "Uzbekistan will consistently continue international cooperation aimed at strengthening dialogue between cultures and religions, enlightenment, and tolerance."
          }
        ]
      }
