            "quote": "We must avoid industrial collapses, the breakdown of production, and energy costs which people cannot afford."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S022",
            "quote": "As such, energy security is vital if we are to ensure the survival of the international economy and to buttress development."
          },
          {
            "sentence_id": "S023",
